cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MatchACell, please cite it as below."
title: "MatchACell: a matcha-themed single-cell type/state annotation toolkit"
abstract: >-
  MatchACell is a Snakemake-based single-cell annotation toolkit. Step 1 is a
  data-driven QC and Leiden cluster-stability optimizer that recommends a
  clustering resolution for downstream annotation (the "MatchA Verdict"), with
  optional GPU acceleration via rapids-singlecell.
authors:
  - family-names: "<Your surname>"
    given-names: "<Your name>"
# Add collaborators as needed.
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/<OWNER>/MatchACell"
keywords:
  - single-cell
  - spatial-transcriptomics
  - clustering
  - leiden
  - snakemake
  - bioinformatics
